{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a87b138-b1ac-8912-bbc3-eef486d1e613",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T13:36:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. My name is Adriana Rivera. I am calling about the water and sewer bill? For where I live."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "294 Marsh Street, in The Point. I rent the apartment there. My landlord says I owe this bill, the water bill. But the letter has his name? So I do not know whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me pull it up. Marsh Street, 294. Give me a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I have it. The account is in the property owner's name, and the bills are mailed to the owner. The city bills the owner of the property. Whether a tenant pays it depends on your lease or whatever you and your landlord agreed to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. So the city says it is his bill? But he can ask me to pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:35:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. To us, it's his account and he's responsible to the city. If your lease says water is included in the rent, or says you pay it, that's between the two of you. I'd look at the lease."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. I am not asking to change it. I only want to understand. It is annoying, he tells me one thing, the paper says another thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. The paper is accurate for our side. It just doesn't say who pays him back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then, is a payment plan possible? If the bill is large, maybe I pay a little each month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:35:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Payment plans would be set up by the account holder, so your landlord would need to call us. If he wants to arrange it, he can. Whether he lets you split it with him is up to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. One more thing? The bill has a date. He said the notice came Monday the ninth, but I think it was Monday the nineteenth? Which one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. The nineteenth of this month is actually today's date minus... hold on, today is Thursday the nineteenth, so Monday the nineteenth can't be right. It would be Monday the ninth. The bill was issued the ninth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:36:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the ninth. Okay. I was wrong. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Anything else I can look up for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for explaining. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Rivera. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
